{"id":"n40825-1-7","stage":4,"title":"날뛰다 · 蹦","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40825-1-7-1","ko":"개들이 왜 이렇게 시끄러워?","zh":"狗们为什么这么吵啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"개들이","meaning":"狗，犬","explanation":"개：狗，犬；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"개","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64115","senseId":"1","lemma":"개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시끄러워?","meaning":"吵闹，喧嚣","explanation":"시끄럽다：吵闹，喧嚣；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"시끄럽다","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15961","senseId":"1","lemma":"시끄럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a57ab05712bfb600","term":"개","zh":"狗，犬","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3","entryId":"64115","definition":"一种以打猎或玩赏等为目的饲养的动物，嗅觉和听觉都很灵敏，头脑聪明，顺从听话。","pronunciation":["개ː"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"72d1507eed9433fb","term":"시끄럽다","zh":"吵闹，喧嚣","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3","entryId":"15961","definition":"声音大而嘈杂，令人听起来厌烦。","pronunciation":["시끄럽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/46abd247fa9f174ddc58.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40825-1-7-2","ko":"눈이 오니까 저렇게 날뛰면서 짖네요.","zh":"因为下雪了，所以它们才那么疯跑还叫个不停。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"눈이","meaning":"雪","explanation":"눈：雪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20198","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오니까","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"저렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렇다","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71226","senseId":"1","lemma":"저렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날뛰면서","meaning":"蹦，跳，跳跃","explanation":"날뛰다：蹦，跳，跳跃；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"날뛰다","audio":"/audio/55f927cfada5d5beb68c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40825","senseId":"1","lemma":"날뛰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짖네요.","meaning":"吠","explanation":"짖다：吠；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"짖다","audio":"/audio/e83d1a1b1a3323ae730a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77748","senseId":"1","lemma":"짖다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"雪","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"20198","definition":"空气中的水气结冰后掉到地面后形成的白色棉花状小冰块。","pronunciation":["눈ː"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"07e99c1628a5077b","term":"저렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3","entryId":"71226","definition":"性质、模样、状态等与那个一样。","pronunciation":["저러타"]},{"id":"55f927cfada5d5be","term":"날뛰다","zh":"蹦，跳，跳跃","audio":"/audio/55f927cfada5d5beb68c.mp3","entryId":"40825","definition":"又蹦又跳，好像要飞起来似的。","pronunciation":["날뛰다"]},{"id":"e83d1a1b1a3323ae","term":"짖다","zh":"吠","audio":"/audio/e83d1a1b1a3323ae730a.mp3","entryId":"77748","definition":"狗大声叫。","pronunciation":["짇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/21071cb000243db58980.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.813,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40825","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":136,"sequenceScore":2.6397,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["狗们为什么这么吵啊？","因为下雪了，所以它们才那么疯跑还叫个不停。","智秀，要怎么给你拍照呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["狗们为什么这么吵啊？","因为下雪了，所以它们才那么疯跑还叫个不停。","智秀，要怎么给你拍照呢？"],"answer":1}]}
